on a mountain peak, surrounded by mist and clouds. The arena is constructed with ancient stone and jade, featuring intricate carvings of mystical symbols and runes. The central area is a large circular stone platform with glowing engravings, bordered by tall stone pillars and flags fluttering in the wind. The distant horizon features rolling mountains and faint outlines of ancient temples, shrouded in mist. The sky is dramatic with soft golden light filtering through dense clouds, creating a divine and majestic atmosphere.*\n\n- **时代闭环约束：**  \n  *No modern elements such as skyscrapers, electricity poles, or concrete roads. The entire scene must adhere to the ancient fantasy aesthetic, with consistent architectural style and material textures. Distant elements like mountains, clouds, and temples must seamlessly match the foreground.*\n\n- **功能逻辑：**  \n  *The central area must be wide and flat, suitable for martial arts duels or magical training. Surrounding structures should reflect an organized and ceremonial design, such as spectator stands or stone paths leading to the arena.*\n\n- **无人与留白：**  \n  *No people or creatures should be visible in the scene. The focus is on the architectural and environmental grandeur, emphasizing the emptiness of the arena.*\n\n---\n\n#### 画面细节：\n1. **中心演武场：**  \n   - 圆形或八角形石平台，表面镶嵌复杂的符文阵法，部分符文可能发出微弱的光芒（如蓝色或金色）。\n   - 平台边缘围绕着一圈古朴的石柱，柱顶悬挂门派旗帜，旗帜随风轻扬。\n   - 地面材质为打磨光滑的青石板，或自然的岩石纹理。\n\n2. **周围观战区：**  \n   - 石阶环绕演武场，形成略高的观战区域。\n   - 石阶两侧可布置雕刻精美的护栏或阵法石碑。\n\n3. **远景与天际线：**  \n   - 远处是连绵起伏的山峦，山间点缀着古代仙府的轮廓，如飞檐楼阁或巨大的石门。\n   - 天际线以云雾为主，阳光穿透云层，投射柔和的光影，增强场景的神圣感。\n\n4. **配色与光影：**  \n   - 场景整体以冷色调为主（青灰、玉白），搭配阵法光芒的暖色点缀（金色、蓝色）。\n   - 光影强调层次感，中央平台光线较亮，周围云雾与远景渐隐于阴影中。\n\n---\n\n#### 生成提示示例：\n*\"A mystical martial arts arena on a mountain peak, surrounded by mist and clouds. The arena features a wide circular stone platform engraved with glowing runes, bordered by tall stone pillars and fluttering flags. Surrounding the arena are stone steps and carved barriers, with distant mountains and ancient temples visible through the mist. The sky is dramatic, with golden light filtering through dense clouds, creating a divine and majestic atmosphere. No people or creatures are visible in the scene, emphasizing the grandeur and emptiness of the environment.\"*"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 129, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [392.0030517578125, 559.9605712890625], "pos": [2590.4638671875, 1973.4676513671875], "widgets_values": ["seedvr2_ema_3b-Q4_K_M.gguf", 1080, "lab", true], "inputs": [{"name": "图像", "link": 104, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "放大模型"}, "name": "放大模型", "label": "放大模型", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "放大模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "最短边尺寸"}, "name": "最短边尺寸", "label": "最短边尺寸", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "最短边尺寸"}, {"widget": {"name": "颜色校对"}, "name": "颜色校对", "label": "颜色校对", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "颜色校对"}, {"widget": {"name": "预览开关"}, "name": "预览开关", "label": "预览开关", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "预览开关"}], "flags": {}, "id": 60, "type": "WujiUpscaler", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "WujiUpscaler"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [128], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-225.28656005859375, 2045.928466796875], "widgets_values": ["一个玄幻世界的门派演武场\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 38, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order